  "description": "* PLEASE EMAIL ONLY AND WE WILL THEN ADVISE ON VIEWING ARRANGEMENTS *\n\nExcellent three bedroom semi detached home to let. The accommodation comes PARTLY furnished and comprises of a living room which is connected to the kitchen dining room. The kitchen opens out to the rear low maintenance garden.  That garden at the rear gets westerly sun and there is off street parking to the front. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms and a single bedroom / study, and the family bathroom room. \n\n\nIn terms of location, the house is located in a very convenient area which is within walking distance of Marley Park, close to Dundrum Town Centre, with all the shops and restaurants on offer there, and also the Nutgrove Shopping Centre. With a selection of good schools nearby and easy access to the M50, this property is a jewel.",
